# MinePulse product thesis

The **real product** is the **AI optimization system** (target: powerful **LangGraph**-style agent graph), not the operational dashboards.

## What is NOT the value prop

- Film / Carte / Performance / Événements views largely **repackage information operators already have** (copied / mocked from existing OCP-style ops tools).
- Do not present MinePulse as “another supervision UI” or as a data-display project.

## What IS the value prop

- A **connected AI layer** that reads Film, Carte, Exceptions, Performance, and events together.
- **Anticipates** future problems (congestion, wait inflation, shovel downtime impact, production gap).
- Produces **ranked decisions / optimisations** to recover tonnage and reduce wait.
- Surfaces recommendations in Optimisation and contextual AI slots — **human decides**: Préparer / Marquer / Ignorer — **never auto-apply**.

## When communicating (PPT, README, demos, UI copy)

- Lead with AI orchestration, anticipation, and decision quality.
- Treat screens as **sensors and action surfaces** for the agent, not the product itself.
- Keep the coherent Merah El Ahrach scenario as the demo world the agent reasons over.
